        "original_id": "8076179c-ad13-5506-98ec-d222042f2197",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Townsend Coleman, Garth Jennings, Christophe Lourdelet, Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Seth MacFarlane, Scarlett Johansson, John C. Reilly, Taron Egerton, Tori Kelly\n- Works: My Life as a Teenage Robot, The Replacements, Knotty, Fantasia 2000, Sing\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, Townsend Coleman voiced Knotty.\n- In 1999, Townsend Coleman contributed additional voices to the film Fantasia 2000.\n- Townsend Coleman also worked on My Life as a Teenage Robot and The Replacements.\n- In 2016, Townsend Coleman contributed additional voices to the film Sing.\n- Sing is a 2016 American film directed and written by Garth Jennings and co-directed by Christophe Lourdelet.\n- Sing stars the voice cast Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Seth MacFarlane, Scarlett Johansson, John C. Reilly, Taron Egerton, and Tori Kelly.",
